<title>USA: Nissan October US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Nissan October US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Oct 1-31, 1996     Oct 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    16,418	    19,790	    -20.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  10,676	    12,387	    -17.0</p>
<p> Import Car		15,179	    14,236	     +2.7</p>
<p> Import Truck	     6,848	     7,212	     -8.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Oct 31, 1996 Jan 1-Oct 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   271,479	   266,182	     +1.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 147,737	   156,551	     -6.4</p>
<p> Import Car	     166,850	   184,669	    -10.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	    57,497	    55,882	     +2.1</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 27 in latest month vs 26, 258 for year to date vs 256 in year ago.</p>
</text>
